<p>One or more analysis objects can be added to an analysis overlay, which =
is then added to the scene view. The analysis overlay can control result vi=
sibility for all analyses it contains, allowing you to manage a set of rela=
ted analyses as a single overlay displayed in the view. A scene view can co=
ntain several analysis overlays.</p>
