alysis classes (a single line of sight analysis, for example) or for an ent=
ire analysis overlay. Toggling the visibility for an analysis overlay will =
affect all the analyses it contains. This allows you to organize your analy=
ses into logical groups and manage their visibility as a single unit.</p><p=
>You can toggle visibility for an individual analysis to show/hide its resu=
lts, or toggle visibility for the analysis overlay (and all analyses it con=
tains) as a group. You can also remove it from the analysis overlay if you =
no longer need it, as well as remove the entire overlay from the scene view=
.</p>
